# Social publishing (social.publish.turbineh): call GET|POST /api/social/publish/run every minute or few minutes with
# the header x-cron-secret: $CRON_SECRET (or Authorization: Bearer — what Vercel Cron sends). At least 32 characters;
# without it the route answers 503 and nothing is published. Shared with jobs.scheduled.turbineh when both are present.
CRON_SECRET=
